<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore financial, business sector rises in Q1.</title>
<headline>Singapore financial, business sector rises in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's financial and business sector grew 10.5 percent in the first quarter of 1997, the Ministry of Trade and Industry said on Friday.</p>
